{{Quote|Normally used as a walking aid, now used as a catalyst for gravity.|Item}}
The '''Gravity Blade''' (formerly known as '''Gravity Cane''') is a {{Rare}} [[sword]].

The Gravity Blade is a very popular choice among sword mains and [[Ice]] users alike, due to its ability to pull opponents back without much need for aim, while also breaking [[Instinct]].

Sometimes not even needing sword stats, it remains a highly-versatile sword for PvP, as its pulls and guaranteed [[Instinct]] break can prove to be very useful when it comes to starting combos, despite only being obtained in the [[Second Sea]].

Disabling screen-shake may also be useful, as the moves have abnormally high FoV distortion.

==Obtainment==
The Gravity Blade can be obtained after defeating [[Orbitus]]. (3-5% chance)

